Package: openhexa
Title: R Client for the 'OpenHEXA' Data Platform
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Bluesquare", email = "dev@bluesquarehub.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Work with 'OpenHEXA' workspaces from R: read and publish datasets, read and write workspace files,
    run saved queries, publish web apps, create notebooks,
    connect to the workspace database and external connections (DHIS2, IASO, PostgreSQL, S3, GCS), and run
    pipelines. Talks to the 'OpenHEXA' 'GraphQL' API.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/BLSQ/openhexa-sdk-r
BugReports: https://github.com/BLSQ/openhexa-sdk-r/issues
